  "construction": "Shorten the X-check row space at parent qubit 0 and puncture the Z checks at that qubit, starting from codes/104-30-8.json. Use the first X check containing qubit 0 as pivot, XOR it into every other X check containing that qubit, remove the pivot check, and delete column 0 from both matrices.",
