  "notes": "Derived from the Jong Yeon Lee pair-partition CPM baseline, not an independent discovery of that construction. Literature novelty of the shortened parameters is unverified. The parent entry is codes/104-30-8.json at upstream commit c665b033956000ca1c058de851b8cd25b1ab289b. The initial trusted board comparison found no exact duplicate or WL-equivalent entry; the differing blocklength also rules out equivalence to the parent by a qubit permutation. The cost of saving one physical qubit is a distance bound of 7 rather than 8 and maximum check weight 14 rather than 8. Independent RIS screens at 10,000, 100,000 and 2,000,000 trials per side all returned 7 (seeds 290927, 290928, 290930, pair depth 16, two threads). No exact-distance or literature-novelty claim is made.",
